jdw|v|To make known in a solemn or official manner; to declare; to proclaim (especially an evil). ; To proclaim in a threatening manner; to threaten by some outward sign or expression. ; To point out as deserving of reprehension or punishment, etc.; to accuse in a threatening manner; to invoke censure upon; to stigmatize.	o:1xt9,67,2~1xt9,67,2
